{"id":"enfance","lemma":"enfance","pos":"noun","rank":1539,"glosses":["childhood"],"ipa":"/ɑ̃.fɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/73/Fr-enfance.ogg/Fr-enfance.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"enfances"},"formAudio":{"enfances":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-enfances.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je la connais depuis mon enfance.","en":"I've known her since I was little.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Cette chanson me rappelle mon enfance.","en":"That song reminds me of my childhood.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"song"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to call again","l":"rappeler"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Parlons de ton enfance.","en":"Let's talk about your childhood.","words":[{"g":"to speak, talk","l":"parler"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"J'ai eu une enfance heureuse.","en":"I had a happy childhood.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"happy","l":"heureux"}]},{"text":"Nous sommes amis depuis notre enfance.","en":"We've been friends since we were kids.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"friend","l":"ami"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"our"},null]}]}